## Bug

`WorkerDaemon.canRunWorker()` compares raw `os.loadavg()[0]` against `maxCpuLoad: 2.0`, but macOS `os.loadavg()` returns system-wide load average — not per-core. On an 8-core Mac at idle, load average is typically 3-8+, so **all workers are perpetually deferred** with "CPU load too high".

