## Root Cause

`worker-daemon.js` line 139-143:
```js
const cpuLoad = os.loadavg()[0];
// ...
if (cpuLoad > this.config.resourceThresholds.maxCpuLoad) {
    return { allowed: false, reason: 'CPU load too high: ...' };
