## Regression 2 — ruvllm coordinator package-name mismatch

**Symptom:**

\`\`\`json
\"ruvllm\": {
  \"coordinator\": \"unavailable\",
  \"trainingBackend\": \"js-fallback\"
}
\`\`\`

**Root cause:** Three source files \`require('@ruvector/ruvllm')\`:

- \`v3/@claude-flow/cli/src/memory/sona-optimizer.ts:146\`
- \`v3/@claude-flow/cli/src/memory/intelligence.ts:726\`
- \`v3/@claude-flow/cli/src/ruvector/lora-adapter.ts:145\`

