— note the \`-wasm\` suffix. There is **no** \`@ruvector/ruvllm\` package in the dep manifest. The symlink at \`node_modules/@ruvector/ruvllm\` exists locally (left over from an older install state with a different package name), but it doesn't ship to npm consumers and the contents are likely stale anyway.

